{"key":"Passives_Enemy-schema.json|/dataList/0/desc","kr_sha":"32782ed9a2d8e1a4b42e8e6b24f17b9f58abc55eabe8b407ca97070d7dcd3851","zh":"適用 [PanicChangeLock] 效果，\n理智值不會降至低於0\n\n本場戰鬥中，對黑雲會 第3組長 美音適用以下效果\n- <color=#ff6000><mark=#ff000040><b><u>與斬擊屬性E.G.O技能拚點時，拚點威力-5</u></b></mark></color>\n- <color=#ff6000><mark=#ff000040><b><u>受到斬擊屬性E.G.O技能造成的傷害+(150/硬幣數量)%</u></b></mark></color>","origin":"claude","since":"raw-20261126","written":"raw-20261126","rules":"a09c206408aeee12a3c09828f18f5dba16cce959","model":"claude-opus-5-5","batch":"20261126T062243-36de3d30"}
{"key":"Passives_Enemy-schema.json|/dataList/0/flavor","kr_sha":"7ea726de4798aa203b2f61185521c04037978ed7c2434366c19d1daf74e95d38","zh":"「以圖式構築而成的表象。透過這場訓練，應該能體驗到很多事。尤其是經理，你特別適合這場訓練。」\n「如果薛西弗斯塔依然健在，你的系統會是什麼模樣呢？」","origin":"claude","since":"raw-20261126","written":"raw-20261126","rules":"a09c206408aeee12a3c09828f18f5dba16cce959","model":"claude-opus-5-5","batch":"20261126T062243-36de3d30"}
